--- !u!114 &4717911345764222600
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3431821412924464103}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'My name is Premou. I carry with me all the information about the terrible
    fate of Proima, our planet, that I could gather in

    the little time that
    I had left.


    We were visited by an advanced device from beyond the sky.
    We believe its job was to detect water and notify whatever

    species built
    it about its location.

    Soon after its arrival, red lights surrounded our
    whole planet, originating from their spaceships.

    It took us too long to
    figure out what they were doing, but I doubt there was anything we could have
    done about it.


    The temperatures began to rapidly rise, and our water evaporated
    at incredible speeds.

    Our best guess is that these invaders are capable
    of absorbing the water in the air without needing to enter the

    atmosphere,
    and they do it by artificially boiling the planet below them.


    Before we
    could even figure anything out, we were forced to retreat deep into the underground
    caves.

    Our cities crumbled to dust as the surface became dry and devoid
    of life.


    We never had the chance to contact them. We never got to fight
    back. We never even saw how they looked.

    We were killed without notice in
    such a quick and merciless way.


    If anyone ever finds this, use this as
    a warning. Your planet might not be safe.


    Premou, last of the Povann.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
